    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "REA FitzGerald Chambers are delighted to present 16 Priory East to the property market. Tucked away in a peaceful neighbourhood, this delightful 3-bedroom mid terraced home offers both comfort and potential. This spacious property is ideally suited for those looking for a home with a fantastic layout, in a prime location, with the opportunity to personalise it to their own style.  As you step inside, you're welcomed by a bright and airy entrance hallway leading to the generous living room, perfect for relaxing or entertaining guests. The separate dining room provides a wonderful space for family meals, while the kitchen offers ample storage and room for dining. Upstairs, you'll find three spacious bedrooms and a full bathroom.  The property enjoys a lovely position, facing a green space, with no properties overlooking it, providing a sense of tranquility and privacy. There is a large driveway to the front and a lovely South East facing garden to the rear.  The property also benefits from double-glazed windows and gas-fired central heating, ensuring warmth and comfort year-round.  It enjoys a wonderful location situated just off the Navan Road. The house is just around the corner from Ashington Park, with Pelletstown Train Station just a 6-minute walk approx. and Broombridge LUAS line is just 1 stop over, at Broombridge Station. There is a good selection of shops, pharmacies, cafes, creches and schools within easy reach. Blanchardstown Shopping Centre is within a 15-minute drive and the property also benefits from easy access to the M50 motorway.  This is a wonderful opportunity to secure a spacious family property in a highly sought-after location. With its fantastic layout, private setting, and easy access to local amenities, 16 Priory East is a place you’ll want to call home!"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "Entrance Hall\r\nOpening from the front door to a spacious hallway with understair storage.\r\n\r\nLiving Room\r\nBay window to front aspect with feature fireplace and laminate flooring.  Interconnected doors leading to……\r\n\r\nDining Room\r\nLaminate flooring and double doors to the garden.\r\n\r\nKitchen\r\nWith ample eye and low level fitted units, plumbed for washing machine and dishwasher, breakfast bar, laminate flooring, ample space for dining and access to rear garden.\r\n\r\nLanding\r\nHot-press and access hatch to attic space.\r\n\r\nMain Bedroom\r\nSizeable double bedroom with window to front aspect with built in wardrobes and laminate flooring.\r\n\r\nBedroom Two\r\nLarge double bedroom with window to rear aspect, storage closet and laminate flooring.\r\n\r\nBedroom Three\r\nGood sized single room with window to front aspect and built in storage/shelving.\r\n\r\nFamily Bathroom\r\nFully tiled with WC, WHB, Bath and overhead shower.\r\n\r\nExterior\r\nTo the front of the property there is ample off-street parking for two cars. The rear garden, South East facing, is landscaped with grey stone patio slabs and has a barna shed."
      },
      {
